    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateDependencyLocks@1, DatasetsDependencyLocks@1, KitDependencyLocks@1, and PlatformDependencyLockCatalog@1. Each component freeze is a declared_release_profile lock of the clean-package runtime authority (Accelerate requirements.txt, Datasets empty setup.py install_requires, Kit pyproject.toml [project].dependencies). Mutable Git, editable, and local-path requires are excluded from the release lock; named Git extras remain source-checkout development only. Hash identity, transitive resolution, wheel/sdist/container identities, and native tools stay typed unavailable. Hashes were not invented. uv under ~/.local is not sealed-environment authority. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
